{"RukuNumber":491,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":64,"SurahIndex":"064","VerseNumber":11,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"مَآ أَصَابَ مِن مُّصِيبَةٍ إِلَّا بِإِذۡنِ ٱللَّهِۗ وَمَن يُؤۡمِنۢ بِٱللَّهِ يَهۡدِ قَلۡبَهُۥۚ وَٱللَّهُ بِكُلِّ شَيۡءٍ عَلِيمٞ","TajweedText":"م<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَصَابَ م<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ِن م</tajweed>ُّصِيبَةٍ إِلَّا بِإِذْنِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ‌ۗ وَم<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن ي</tajweed>ُؤْم<tajweed class=iqlab>ِنۢ ب</tajweed>ِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ يَهْدِ قَلْبَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed>‌ۚ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهُ بِكُلِّ شَىْءٍ عَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٌ <span class=end>١١</span>","End":"١١","PageNumber":557,"JuzNumber":28,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":491,"MaqraNumber":222,"HizbNumber":56,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":64,"SurahIndex":"064","VerseNumber":12,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَأَطِيعُواْ ٱللَّهَ وَأَطِيعُواْ ٱلرَّسُولَۚ فَإِن تَوَلَّيۡتُمۡ فَإِنَّمَا عَلَىٰ رَسُولِنَا ٱلۡبَلَٰغُ ٱلۡمُبِينُ","TajweedText":"وَأَطِيعُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهَ وَأَطِيعُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>رَّسُولَ‌ۚ فَإِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ت</tajweed>َوَلَّيْتُمْ فَإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َمَا عَلَىٰ رَسُولِنَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْبَلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>غُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نُ <span class=end>١٢</span>","End":"١٢","PageNumber":557,"JuzNumber":28,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":491,"MaqraNumber":222,"HizbNumber":56,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":64,"SurahIndex":"064","VerseNumber":13,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"ٱللَّهُ لَآ إِلَٰهَ إِلَّا هُوَۚ وَعَلَى ٱللَّهِ فَلۡيَتَ